08:11:13.547 | North road nearing Tasur'ke. (road)
08:11:13.548 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. Crackling ozone heralds warp-touched mirage, their coming the advent of change. Vines have overtaken this location. The sun sets, its dimming rays lancing across the sky and lighting the dim edges of cloud that hang there. The smell of brine is unmistakable here as you realise that you are near a large body of water. You can hear the crashing of waves against something, possibly rocks. Immediately to your west, the road cuts through grassy plains while to the northeast, the orange dirt of the road gradually becomes sandy as it nears the ocean. Resting on the ground is a cube-shaped silver sigil. A large cart rests here, stacked high with assorted containers secured with thick rope. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. A scorching wall of fire stands here, blocking passage to the west. There are 2 black-crowned nycticoraxes here. Exuding a most fearful atmosphere, a terrifying chimera ominously skulks about here. A fierce mountain falcon surveys the surroundings with keen eyes. Staring about himself with an eternal frown, a spectral gorilla broods here. A massive creature of rock and earth sits immobile as a stone. A vicious death adder is here, hood flared in warning. There are 3 clusters of snow blossoms here. A group of chunks of animal fat lies here in a pile. A long wooden arrow lies here. A globe of light is here hovering. A sphere of crackling electricity has coalesced. A holocaust globe is here. An unnatural darkness cloaks the location. Slave Morasla, Pestilent Disciple is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by a darkened mask dripping with gold. She wields Adchachel's lament in her right hand. Truthseeker Vasyly is riding on a dreadful chimera. He wields Reaver, a dark brass morningstar in his left hand and Sentinel, a darkened-silver morningstar in his right. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a silvery spectral gorilla. Her features are obscured by Revelation's Guise. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right.
