08:11:28.585 | North road nearing Tasur'ke. (road)
08:11:28.631 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. Crackling ozone heralds warp-touched mirage, their coming the advent of change. The stars glimmer down, broken only upon occasion by thin wisps of clouds. The smell of brine is unmistakable here as you realise that you are near a large body of water. You can hear the crashing of waves against something, possibly rocks. Immediately to your west, the road cuts through grassy plains while to the northeast, the orange dirt of the road gradually becomes sandy as it nears the ocean. Resting on the ground is a cube-shaped silver sigil. A large cart rests here, stacked high with assorted containers secured with thick rope. The opaque form of a phantom harp seal drifts here. A scorching wall of fire stands here, blocking passage to the west. There are 2 black-crowned nycticoraxes here. Exuding a most fearful atmosphere, a terrifying chimera ominously skulks about here. A fierce mountain falcon surveys the surroundings with keen eyes. Staring about himself with an eternal frown, a spectral gorilla broods here. A massive creature of rock and earth sits immobile as a stone. A vicious death adder is here, hood flared in warning. There are 3 clusters of snow blossoms here. A group of chunks of animal fat lies here in a pile. A long wooden arrow lies here. A globe of light is here hovering. A very large group of bisemutum chips rests here. A very large group of calcite motes rests here. There are 3 corpses of a ghost bat here. A very large group of ferrum flakes rests here. There is one golden sovereign here. An unnatural darkness cloaks the location. Slave Morasla, Pestilent Disciple is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by a darkened mask dripping with gold. She wields Adchachel's lament in her right hand. Kaden Ashaela-Darke, Scarlatti's Elegance is here. His features are obscured by a thin mask of golden paint. He wields a shadowy staff of restrained power in his left hand and a Scimitar of Falcons in his right. The soul of Vasyly roams the land, bodiless. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a silvery spectral gorilla. Her features are obscured by Revelation's Guise. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right.
