08:12:07.251 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. Crackling ozone heralds warp-touched mirage, their coming the advent of change. An ominous crimson glow blankets this location as flames lick hungrily at the surroundings. Vines have overtaken this location. The stars glimmer down, broken only upon occasion by thin wisps of clouds. The road hobbles eastward and westward here as you find yourself completely surrounded by a grassy plain. To the east, you think you can hear the lapping of the ocean surf while to the west the trees of the Northern Ithmia extend southwards. Your examination of the environment is soon interrupted as the howl of a powerful wind penetrates from the north and makes concentration much more difficult. An icewall is here, blocking passage to the southwest. An icewall is here, blocking passage to the west. A scorching wall of fire stands here, blocking passage to the east. Staring about himself with an eternal frown, a spectral gorilla broods here. The wild gleam gone from his eyes, a kelpie lies here dead. A dryad's broken body lies here, battered brutally. There are 2 black-crowned nycticoraxes here. There are 3 corpses of an ursu man here. An unnatural darkness cloaks the location. Slave Morasla, Pestilent Disciple is here, hidden. Her features are obscured by a darkened mask dripping with gold. She wields Adchachel's lament in her right hand. The soul of Froedine roams the land, bodiless. Eradicator Maldrantus is here, hidden. His features are obscured by a mask of lifevision. He wields Gattan'lier's hunger in his left hand and Agith'maal's ire in his right. Tyndran Tabethys Aristata, Tyrannical Butcher of Baelgrim is riding on a silvery spectral gorilla. Her features are obscured by Revelation's Guise. She wields a Shield of Absorption in her left hand and an exquisite Mhaldorian staff of sterling silver in her right. Wreathed in torrid fury, the Elemental Lord Agathon blazes bright. He wields a Shield of Absorption in his left hand.
